    text "The log" @388,206.68 #ece6d8 Space Grotesk 20
    text ":Log (or :messages) opens the log at the bottom. It lists every notice and Oriel's own" @388,237.59813 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "log records, newest last, in three scopes: Oriel's, the session in front, and all of them" @388,256.93262 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "together." @388,276.2671 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "·" @388,304.60156 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "The chips filter by severity; the box filters by text, or source:init.lua." @400.03125,304.60156 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "·" @388,326.93604 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "Click an entry to open its stack trace and the source around the failing line." @400.03125,326.93604 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "·" @388,349.2705 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "Copy copies the open entry, or everything shown; Copy report copies a report for" @400.03125,349.2705 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "a bug." @400.03125,368.60498 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "·" @388,390.93945 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text ":Log level debug shows debug records from now on." @400.03125,390.93945 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
